---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><span class="todo">TODO: Vor dem Launch prüfen. Vorlage für eine Seite ohne Cookies, ohne Tracking, ohne Formular. Kein Rechtsrat.</span></p>
    <h2>Controller</h2>
    <p>Stephan <span class="todo">Nachname, Adresse</span>, Austria. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>This website is hosted by Netlify, Inc., 512 2nd Street, Suite 200, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA. When you visit the site, Netlify processes technical data such as your IP address, browser type and time of access in server log files. This is necessary to deliver the website securely (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Data may be transferred to the USA; Netlify relies on the EU Standard Contractual Clauses and the EU-US Data Privacy Framework.</p>
    <h2>Fonts</h2>
    <p>All fonts are hosted on this server. No connection to Google or other font providers is made.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>This website uses no cookies, no analytics and no tracking tools.</p>
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>If you contact me by email, I use your details only to answer your request (Art. 6(1)(b) and (f) GDPR) and delete them when they are no longer needed.</p>
    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>This site links to Instagram and YouTube. These services only process data once you click a link and leave this site.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection. You can also lodge a complaint with the Austrian Data Protection Authority (Datenschutzbehörde, dsb.gv.at).</p>
  </div>
</Base>
